        <item>
            <title>3.13.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:29:27 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>181</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Control API: `open_session` takes `resumeSessionId` to continue a closed session — or one a daemon restart dropped — in the same conversation, with its full context. It reopens in the session's own folder and keeps its model and permission mode unless you override them. `initialPrompt` is sent as the next turn and returns a `replyId`. If the session is already open, its `key` is returned instead of opening it twice. Refusals carry an `errorCode` (`no_transcript`, `folder_missing`, `cwd_mismatch`, …).
- Control API: `list_sessions` with `scope: "recent"` now lists past sessions with `sessionId`, `startedAt`, and the first prompt. Filter by `project`, a `since` / `until` period, or `query` words across the title, project, folder and first prompt; `includeOpen` adds open sessions. Filters search every session on the Mac, not just the newest 50.
- `canopyctl`: new `resume <sessionId>` (or `open --resume`) and `sessions` (`--project`, `--query`, `--since`, `--until`, `--table`) commands.

### Bug Fixes
- The status bar's output rate no longer counts thinking tokens.
]]></description>
